INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (3,'Air Jordan 1 Low','air-jordan-1-low','Inspired by the original that debuted in 1985, the Air Jordan 1 Low offers a clean, classic look that\'s familiar yet always fresh. With an iconic design that pairs perfectly with any \'fit, these kicks ensure you\'ll always be on point.','',3,1,8995.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-16 09:54:15','2026-07-16 09:54:15'),(10,'Apple iphone 13 mini','Apple-iphone-13-mini','iPhone 13. boasts an advanced dual-camera system that allows you to click mesmerising pictures with immaculate clarity. Furthermore, the lightning-fast A15 Bionic chip allows for seamless multitasking, elevating your performance to a new dimension. A big leap in battery life, a durable design, and a bright Super Retina XDR display facilitate boosting your user experience.','Display: 5.4-inch Super Retina XDR OLED >\nResolution: 2340 × 1080 pixels, 476 ppi >\nBrightness: 800 nits typical, 1,200 nits HDR >\nProtection: Ceramic Shield front, IP68 water and dust resistance >\nProcessor: Apple A15 Bionic chip >\nCPU: 6-core CPU >\nGPU: 4-core GPU >\nNeural Engine: 16-core Neural Engine >\nRear Camera: Dual 12MP camera system >\nMain Camera: 12MP, f/1.6 aperture, sensor-shift OIS >\nUltra-Wide Camera: 12MP, f/2.4 aperture, 120° field of view >\nCamera Features: Night mode, Deep Fusion, Smart HDR 4, Photographic Styles >\nVideo: 4K Dolby Vision HDR recording up to 60 fps >\nFront Camera: 12MP TrueDepth camera, f/2.2 aperture >\nStorage Options: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB >\nNetwork: 5G, 4G LTE, Wi‑Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0 >\nSIM: Dual SIM, nano-SIM and eSIM >\nSecurity: Face ID facial recognition >\nLocation: GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, QZSS and BeiDou >\nBattery: Up to 17 hours video playback >\nCharging: Lightning connector, MagSafe up to 15W, Qi wireless up to 7.5W >\nFast Charging: Up to 50% in around 30 minutes with a 20W adapter or higher >\nOperating System: iOS >\nWidth: 64.2 mm >\nHeight: 131.5 mm >\nThickness: 7.65 mm >\nWeight: 140 g >\nBuild: Aluminium frame, glass back',2,NULL,64900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-16 15:21:57','2026-07-16 16:02:05'),(12,'Apple iPhone 13','apple-iphone-13','iPhone 13. boasts an advanced dual-camera system that allows you to click mesmerising pictures with immaculate clarity. Furthermore, the lightning-fast A15 Bionic chip allows for seamless multitasking, elevating your performance to a new dimension. A big leap in battery life, a durable design, and a bright Super Retina XDR display facilitate boosting your user experience.','',2,NULL,79900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 05:35:59','2026-07-17 05:35:59'),(13,'Apple iphone 13 Pro Max','apple-iphone-13-pro-max','Apple iPhone 13 Pro Max features a 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR display, A15 Bionic chip, 12MP triple camera system, and long-lasting battery. It delivers fast performance, premium design, and an excellent photography experience.','Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nProcessor: Apple A15 Bionic\nRAM: 6 GB\nStorage: 128 GB / 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera: 12 MP + 12 MP + 12 MP\nFront Camera: 12 MP\nBattery: 4352 mAh\nOperating System: iOS\n5G: Yes\nFace ID: Yes\nColor: Sierra Blue, Silver, Gold, Graphite\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,129900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 07:20:01','2026-07-17 07:20:01'),(14,'Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max','apple-iphone-14-pro-max','Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max is a premium flagship smartphone with a 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display, powerful A16 Bionic chip, Dynamic Island, 48MP Pro camera system, and all-day battery life. It delivers exceptional performance, stunning photography, and fast 5G connectivity.','Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nProcessor: Apple A16 Bionic\nRAM: 6 GB\nStorage: 128 GB / 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera: 48 MP + 12 MP + 12 MP\nFront Camera: 12 MP\nBattery: 4323 mAh\nOperating System: iOS\nNetwork: 5G\nDynamic Island: Yes\nFace ID: Yes\nCharging: Lightning Port, MagSafe Wireless Charging\nColors: Deep Purple, Gold, Silver, Space Black\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,134900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 14:42:26','2026-07-18 07:25:48'),(15,'Apple  iPhone 15 Pro Max','apple-iphone-15-pro-max','The Apple iPhone 15 Pro Max is Apple\'s premium flagship smartphone, featuring a lightweight titanium design, a powerful A17 Pro chip, a stunning 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR display with ProMotion, and a professional 48MP camera system with 5x optical zoom. It delivers exceptional performance, long battery life, USB-C connectivity, and advanced security with Face ID, making it ideal for photography, gaming, and everyday use. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}','Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nResolution: 2796 × 1290 pixels\nRefresh Rate: 120Hz ProMotion\nProcessor: Apple A17 Pro Chip\nRAM: 8 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera: 48 MP + 12 MP Ultra Wide + 12 MP 5x Telephoto\nFront Camera: 12 MP TrueDepth\nBattery: 4422 mAh\nOperating System: iOS\nNetwork: 5G\nSIM: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM + eSIM)\nUSB: USB-C\nWater Resistance: IP68\nSecurity: Face ID\nColors: Black Titanium, White Titanium, Blue Titanium, Natural Titanium\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,159900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 15:10:26','2026-07-17 15:10:26'),(21,'Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max','apple-iphone-16-pro-max','The Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max is Apple\'s most advanced flagship smartphone, featuring a premium titanium design, a large 6.9-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display with ProMotion technology, the powerful A18 Pro chip, and an advanced 48MP Pro camera system. It delivers exceptional performance, AI-powered features, long-lasting battery life, USB-C connectivity, and 5G support, making it perfect for photography, gaming, content creation, and professional use.','Display: 6.9-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nResolution: 2868 × 1320 pixels\nRefresh Rate: 120Hz ProMotion\nProcessor: Apple A18 Pro Chip\nRAM: 8 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera:\n• 48 MP Fusion Camera\n• 48 MP Ultra Wide Camera