solution play at 60fps,3 all without needing to play on a TV, Play Your Game Collection PlayStation Portal Remote Player can play compatible games you have installed on your PS5 console, including your favorite games for PS5 and PS4.2','',7,NULL,34999.00,6.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 15:51:17','2026-07-18 15:51:17'),(38,'SONY Playstation5 Digital Edition','sony-playstation5-digital-edition','PS5Console Digital Edition, Wireless controller, 2 Horizontal Stand Feet, HDMI cable, AC power cord, USB cable, printed materials, ASTROs PLAYROOM (Pre-installed game)','',7,NULL,49990.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 16:16:23','2026-07-18 16:16:23'),(39,'Xbox Series X 1TB Digital Gaming Console','xbox-series-x-1tb-digital-gaming-console','Take gaming to a whole new level with the Xbox Series X 1TB Gaming Console, a powerhouse designed to deliver unparalleled speed, performance, and stunning visuals. Powered by a custom AMD Zen 2 8-core processor and RDNA 2 GPU, this console offers 12 teraflops of raw graphical power, bringing next-generation gaming with real-time ray tracing, ultra-fast load times, and up to 120 FPS gameplay. Whether you\'re an eSports enthusiast, a casual gamer, or a home entertainment user, the Xbox Series X provides an immersive, seamless, and visually breathtaking experience. Key Features Unmatched Performance and Speed Ultra-Fast 1TB NVMe SSD allows quick game switching, lightning-fast load times, and near-instant resume. 120 FPS Gameplay with Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) for the most fluid and responsive gaming experience. Smart Delivery ensures you play the best available version of your games across console generations. True 4K Gaming and Visual Fidelity','',8,NULL,89900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:01:01','2026-07-18 17:01:01'),(40,'Xbox Series X 1TB Disc Edition','xbox-series-x-1tb-disc-edition','Take gaming to a whole new level with the Xbox Series X 1TB Gaming Console, a powerhouse designed to deliver unparalleled speed, performance, and stunning visuals. Powered by a custom AMD Zen 2 8-core processor and RDNA 2 GPU, this console offers 12 teraflops of raw graphical power, bringing next-generation gaming with real-time ray tracing, ultra-fast load times, and up to 120 FPS gameplay. Whether you\'re an eSports enthusiast, a casual gamer, or a home entertainment user, the Xbox Series X provides an immersive, seamless, and visually breathtaking experience. Key Features Unmatched Performance and Speed Ultra-Fast 1TB NVMe SSD allows quick game switching, lightning-fast load times, and near-instant resume. 120 FPS Gameplay with Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) for the most fluid and responsive gaming experience. Smart Delivery ensures you play the best available version of your games across console generations. True 4K Gaming and Visual Fidelity','',8,NULL,99999.00,4.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:07:57','2026-07-18 17:07:57'),(41,'Sony DualSense Wireless Controller','sony-dualsense-wireless-controller','Bring gaming worlds to life - a) feel your in-game actions and Environment simulated through haptic feedback2, b)experience varying force and tension at your fingertips with adaptive triggers2;Chat online through the built-in microphone3, connect a headset directly via the 3.5mm jack, Switch voice capture on & off using the dedicated mute button, record & broadcast your epic gaming moments, Enjoy a comfortable, evolved design with an iconic layout and enhanced sticks, intuitively interact with select games using the integrated motion sensor;Hear higher-fidelity1 sound effects through the built-in Speaker in supported games','',7,NULL,6399.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:38:07','2026-07-22 09:16:02'),(42,'Sony Dualsense Edge Wireless Controller','sony-dualsense-edge-wireless-controller','Changeable stick caps, remappable inputs and custom settings make your DualSense Edge wireless controller uniquely yours. Fine tune your aim by adjusting stick sensitivity and dead zones, set the travel distance of your triggers for faster inputs, and quickly swap between control profiles so you’re always ready for your next game, Swappable back buttons can be configured to any other button input, so you’ve always got game-changing actions and essential controls at your fingertips. Plus, with two different styles of button to choose from, you can pick an input type that feels just right for your playstyle.','',7,NULL,18999.00,4.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:43:49','2026-07-18 17:43:49'),(43,'DualSense Wireless Controller – Ghost of Yōtei Gold Limited Edition ​','dualsense-wireless-controller-ghost-of-y-tei-gold-limited-edition','Haptic Feedback: You are the Ghost. Feel the rumble of your horse’s gallop as you ride across a majestic Japanese countryside and feel the clang of perfectly forged steel as you battle your way toward revenge with the DualSense wireless controller, Adaptive Triggers: Steady your blade and prepare to execute surgically precise combos with the DualSense wireless controller’s adaptive triggers.','',7,NULL,14999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:51:39','2026-07-18 17:51:39'),(45,'OnePlus Nord 5 5G','oneplus-nord-5-5g','The OnePlus Nord 5 5G is a premium mid-range smartphone designed to deliver flagship-level performance and an exceptional user experience. It features a vibrant 6.83-inch AMOLED display with a smooth 144Hz refresh rate, the powerful Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 processor, an advanced 50MP AI dual-camera system, and a large 6800mAh battery with ultra-fast 80W SUPERVOOC charging. With 5G connectivity and OxygenOS, it is perfect for gaming, photography, entertainment, and everyday productivity.','Model: OnePlus Nord 5 5G\n\nDisplay: 6.83-inch AMOLED\n\nResolution: 2800 × 1272 pixels (1.5K)\n\nRefresh Rate: 144Hz\n\nProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 8s Gen 3\n\nRAM: 8 GB / 12 GB / 16 GB\n\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB\n\nRear Camera:\n• 50 MP Wide (OIS)\n• 8 MP Ultra Wide\n\nFront Camera: 50 MP\n\nBattery: 6800 mAh\n