s	HTC Vive\nSpecific Uses For Product	Training and simulations\nAge Range (Description)	Adult\nModel Name	HTC VIVE Pro Full Kit Virtual Reality System\nOperating System	Windows\nField Of View	110 Degrees',25,NULL,347990.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-01 06:42:14','2026-08-01 06:42:14'),(83,'HTC Vive Focus Vision','htc-vive-focus-vision','The HTC Vive Focus Vision – Consumer Edition is a premium Mixed Reality (MR) and PC VR headset designed for immersive gaming, productivity, and professional applications. It supports both standalone mixed reality and PC VR, featuring full-color passthrough, 3D spatial audio, gesture tracking, inside-out tracking, an adjustable IPD dial, and a detachable battery. The package includes VIVE controllers for precise interaction and seamless VR experiences.','Brand	HTC\nColour	Black\nSpecial Feature	3D Spatial Audio, Adjustable Headband, Detachable Battery, Gesture Tracking, IPD Adjustment Dial, Passthrough Camera3D Spatial Audio, Adjustable Headband, Detachable Battery, Gesture Tracking, IPD Adjustment Dial, Passthrough Camera\nConnectivity Technology	Wireless\nIncluded Components	AC Adapter, Cable, Drivers (L, R)\nCompatible Devices	Personal Computer\nSpecific Uses For Product	Gaming, productivity, mixed reality\nAge Range (Description)	Adult\nModel Name	VIVE Focus Vision\nProduct Dimensions	33.8D x 37.1W x 12.4H Centimeters',25,NULL,209119.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-01 06:50:25','2026-08-01 06:50:25'),(84,'Apple Watch Ultra 3 GPS','apple-watch-ultra-3-gps','Apple Watch Ultra 3 GPS + Cellular 49mm Black Titanium Case with Black Ocean Band','Operating System	WatchOS\nMemory Storage Capacity	64 GB\nSpecial Feature	Activity Tracker, Alarm Clock, Always On Display, Fall Detection, GPS\nBattery Capacity	0.1 Milliamp Hours\nConnectivity Technology	Bluetooth, Cellular',2,NULL,81900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-01 07:12:07','2026-08-01 07:12:07'),(87,'Titan Celestor 2.0 Smartwatch','titan-celestor-2-0-smartwatch','Tit