 classic, inspired by the retro cricket shoes of the 1970s and 80s.Quiet Edge is built on the low-profile cricket shoe of the 1970s and 80s, a silhouette that worked for decades before anyone called it a style. The Old Army Panelling on the forefoot, the suede overlays, the wider toebox: details pulled forward, not redesigned.','',52,1,4999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-14 17:03:02','2026-08-14 17:03:02'),(151,'Nike Tiempo Maestro Elite','nike-tiempo-maestro-elite','Wreaking havoc on the defence requires total command of the ball. That\'s why we designed every aspect of the Tiempo Maestro Elite to put you in complete control of every touch. Its all-new Techleather material, softer than natural leather, combines with a flexible Maestro360 plate to give you a glove-like fit no matter where the ball strikes\nColour Shown: White|Bright Crimson|Blur\nStyle: HQ3157-101\n','Wreaking havoc on the defence requires total command of the ball. That\'s why we designed every aspect of the Tiempo Maestro Elite to put you in complete control of every touch. Its all-new Techleather material, softer than natural leather, combines with a flexible Maestro360 plate to give you a glove-like fit no matter where the ball strikes.\nSuper-soft Ball Touch\nIn the upper and positioned where you need it for creative dribbling, Techleather is a super-soft material. It provides a more consistent touch in wet or dry conditions than natural leather. Its moulded lines enhance the touch experience.\n\nGlove-Like Fit\nUp top, Techleather adapts to the shape of your foot for an accommodating fit. At the bottom, the Maestro360 split plate, located at the forefoot and heel, allows the synthetic leather of the upper to wrap the arch of your foot to further enhance the feeling of a glove-like fit.\n\nTraction for the pitch\nBladed studs on the outsole at the heel and forefoot provide traction for gripping the field. Twisted conical studs help you plant and pivot with ease.\n\nProduct Details\nFor use on dry, natural-grass pitches\nCushioned sockliner\nNet Quantity: 1 Pair of Shoes',3,NULL,12999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-15 07:31:24','2026-08-15 07:31:24'),(152,'KING TOP FG/AG Football Boots','king-top-fg-ag-football-boots','PRODUCT STORY\nTradition and innovation – that’s classic KING. The retro-inspired KING TOP combines classic KING elements, such as the fold-over tongue and deco stitching, with a completely re-engineered lightweight outsole and a new upper. Retro KING branding adds the finishing touch.\n\nFEATURES & BENEFITS\nThe upper of this shoe is made with at least 20% recycled materials as a step toward a better future.\nDETAILS\nSuper soft and sustainable microfiber upper material.\nLightweight Peba outsole with conical stud configuration. Suitable for use on both firm natural surfaces and artificial grass (4G).\nRegular fit\nFG/AG: Firm Ground/Artificial Ground\nStyle: 107348_01\nColor: PUMA Black-PUMA White-PUMA Gold','PRODUCT STORY\nTradition and innovation – that’s classic KING. The retro-inspired KING TOP combines classic KING elements, such as the fold-over tongue and deco stitching, with a completely re-engineered lightweight outsole and a new upper. Retro KING branding adds the finishing touch.\n\nFEATURES & BENEFITS\nThe upper of this shoe is made with at least 20% recycled materials as a step toward a better future.\nDETAILS\nSuper soft and sustainable microfiber upper material.\nLightweight Peba outsole with conical stud configuration. Suitable for use on both firm natural surfaces and artificial grass (4G).\nRegular fit\nFG/AG: Firm Ground/Artificial Ground\nMATERIAL INFORMATION\nSockliner: 100% Textile\nOutsole: 100% Synthetic\nUpper: 100% Synthetic\nLining: 100% Synthetic\nMANUFACTURER\'S ADDRESS\nKAOWAY SPORTS LTD\nKH\n-\nManhattan (Svay Rieng)\nSpecial Economic Zone,\nSangkat Bavet , Krong Bavet,',43,NULL,9999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-15 07:39:22','2026-08-15 07:39:22'),(153,'Cover Drive 18 X','cover-drive-18-x','Fabric & Care\nKeep your one8 footwear looking fresh by wiping it regularly with a clean, dry cloth to remove dust and surface dirt. Avoid washing, soaking, or machine cleaning, as this can damage the material and structure.\nColour:\nJersey White - Sonic Blue - Trophy Go','Command the crease\nWorn by the best in the world. Every gold-finished spike, every engineered detail - for the batsman who doesn\'t wait for the game to come to them. This is precision under pressure, at its most uncompromising.',52,NULL,13999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-15 08:00:17','2026-08-15 08:00:17'),(154,'Cover Drive 18 Pro','cover-drive-18-pro','High-performance batting spikes engineered for total technical command.\nCo-created with Virat Kohli, the Cover Drive 18 Pro is a technical breakthrough for the modern batter. A breathable mono mesh upper, reinforced with synthetic overlays for toe protection. A PWR+LCK heel-lock collar that keeps the foot anchored through powerful movements. The Boom logo, engineered as a TPU shank for torsional rigidity and lateral stability. Expect to feel grounded at the crease and ready for high-intensity pressure.\n\n\nMarketed by:\nAgilitas Brands Private Limited, 02B-109, Roshni Tech Hub, Marathahalli Main Road, Lakshminarayana Pura, EPIP Zone, Chinnapanna Halli, Marathahalli Colony, Bangalore - 560037.\n\nCountry of origin: India\n\nNet quantity: 1 pair\n\nFor customer complaints: click here\nColour:\nJersey White - Sonic Blue - Classic Black\n\n','The crease is where intent becomes innings. Every metal spike, every engineered detail - built for the batsman who doesn\'t wait for the game to come to them. This is precision under pressure, at its most uncompromising.',52,NULL,13999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-15 08:09:08','2026-08-15 08:09:08'),(155,'SG Savage Spike 1.0 Cricket Shoes','sg-savage-spike-1-0-cricket-shoes','SG Savage Spike 1.0 Cricket Shoes designed for power, precision, comfort and performance.','Type: Cricket Shoes 