e on the cart value below Rs. 699/-.\nWe ship on all week days (Monday to Saturday), excluding public holidays. \n \n\nRETURNS\nThe Bata return policy allows you to return items purchased on our online store within 30 days from the date of purchase.\nReturn request can be raised at Bata customer care on 72 899 00000 or email us at in-customer.service@bata.com for further queries.\nOnce the return is requested, it may take our courier 5 working days to pick up your order..\nPlease return the products in their original condition including the barcodes and packaging.\nRefund where applicable, shall be initiated upon the successful pick up and quality check of the article.\nIn case of Customer Returns, the Shipping Fee will not be refunded.',56,NULL,6999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-20 05:27:29','2026-08-20 05:27:29'),(159,'Power Black Sports Sandals For Men','power-black-sports-sandals-for-men','Discover ultimate comfort and style with the bata black sporty sandals for men. perfect for everyday wear, these sandals blend durability with a sporty edge. the sleek black design complements any casual outfit, while the cushioned footbed ensures all-day comfort. ideal for beach strolls or city outings, these sandals are your go-to choice for both relaxation and adventure.','Specification	Details\nBrand	Power by Bata\nType	Sports Sandals\nColour	Black\nUpper Material	PU Synthetic\nOutsole	EVA / Phylon\nLining	Lycra\nClosure	Velcro/Hook & Loop\nSizes	UK 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11\nArticle Number	8616816\nCountry of Origin	India\nMRP	₹799\nSuitable for	Casual wear, walking, outdoor use',56,1,799.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-08-23 06:31:04','2026-08-23 06:31:04'),(160,'Bata Comfit Tan Sandals For Men','bata-comfit-tan-sandals-for-men','Step into comfort and style with the Bata Comfit Sandals for Men, designed to keep you at ease throughout your day. Whether you’re heading out for a casual stroll or running errands, these sandals offer the perfect blend of durability and br